## ⚠️ Limitations

* The dataset represents historical funding records.
* Some records may contain missing values.
* Investment amounts may not be available for every funding record.
* The analysis depends on the information available in the dataset.
* The dashboard should not be interpreted as real-time startup investment data.
* Investment amounts and investor information may contain inconsistencies in the original dataset.

